// edits pixels in those exact regions — closes one eye, widens the
// mouth — before downsampling, so the wink and the smile land where
// they actually are instead of a guess at a coarse grid. The curl (a
// thin decorative wisp, a couple of percent of the icon's width) isn't
// its own connected shape in the source, so its "sway" is a manually
// boxed slice of the same hair mass shifted a few pixels — subtle by
// nature, kept anyway.
//
